'...' as inferred array length: inferred-length array literals [...]T{} are not implemented (rejected at parse with 'expected expression'). The '...' lexes as one token, but this test does not isolate maximal munch (rejection is identical for one or three tokens), so it cites lex.punctuation.set only. spec §5.12; same gap as conformance/spec/13-expressions/041; claude-todo (Ch.5).
